{"channelId":"UCwNethx2yWAQj05ud7y8z0g","row":["H&B Farms",254,"H&B Farm is the realization of a lifelong dream of Jennifer & Matthew Johnson to own a working farm.  Having both been raised on small farms, Jennifer and Matthew have been living in the city for most of their adult lives.  Now comes the chance to return to rural living.  Having completed a renovation to the house, plans to expand the farm into a working farm with chickens, horses, and other animals are not far behind.  Add to that a few crops and you have a recipe for country living at its finest.  Join us as we share our adventures with you!","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwNethx2yWAQj05ud7y8z0g","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwNethx2yWAQj05ud7y8z0g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:45.885Z","channelId":"UCwNethx2yWAQj05ud7y8z0g","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"c526ccebed6c6aece9d3cb8efbf98136780e307a3935adb1dcaf1170bfe673b5","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"fed8e8b71e9f117759d3d3c449e52dfaf6a629d1483cd0fce3a8460d0960e939"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwNethx2yWAQj05ud7y8z0g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:49:22.192Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwNethx2yWAQj05ud7y8z0g","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":254,"raw":"254 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwNethx2yWAQj05ud7y8z0g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:45.885Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"chiropractors","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PlvTP2ODO_Q"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","e